                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="20" connectable="0" parent="11" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];" value="&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;pnpm links&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;the packages&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;in global bin/path&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.1212" y="2" as="geometry">
                        <mxPoint x="-1" as="offset"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#008a00;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#005700;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;pnpm Linking Architecture&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="390" width="366" x="220" y="870" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="110" x="231" y="490" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="29" parent="7" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="1. pnpm builds the packages by combining the files from store using hard links and symlinks" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="50" width="366" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="188" parent="7" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2. pnpm has one habit, it will first always create a hardlink of the package, from the actual stored files, and then this hardlink package will be used to symlink another folder, and this symlink package folder will be used&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Reason why pnpm does like this: -&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;To easily rebuild the hardlink folder for the bad installs or expired rebuild and then just symlink to correct package&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;To &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(102, 102, 0));&quot;&gt;easily manage all the version of same pack&lt;/span&gt;age&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="160" width="366" y="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="146" parent="7" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Why cant pnpm directly hardlink in the main node_modules folder for all the packages: -&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Hardlinking the files for every packages will also require hardlinking the files for the nested dependencies too, and because &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;hardlinking can only be done for files and not folder this would slower the file system process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="150" width="366" y="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="27" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#cce5ff;strokeColor=#36393d;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;packages mapping&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="270" width="360" x="1200" y="-830" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="110" x="1000" y="-690" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="25" parent="27" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="1.&amp;nbsp;pnpm maintains a SQLite-backed index (&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 102, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;index.db&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;) to store the tarball hash of downloaded package and map the files that package contain" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="60" width="360" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="94" parent="27" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;pnpm maintains metadata about what&#39;s already in its store.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;This index.db has two columns first col is key with package hash as a key and second stores the meta data of that package&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="90" width="360" y="90" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="148" parent="27" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="Meta data includes: -&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="90" width="360" y="180" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="215" edge="1" parent="1" source="12" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=1.006;exitY=0.037;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;" target="211">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#d80073;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#A50040;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;packages linking in local projects&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="350" width="350" x="-225" y="1411" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="110" x="-200" y="710" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="13" parent="12" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;pnpm creates a hidden folder inside our project node modules -&amp;gt; node_modules/.pnpm. &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 102, 102));&quot;&gt;This is called virtual store&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 153, 153));&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;This is here the actual contents live. &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;one subfolder per exact package version&lt;/span&gt; (for all dependencies, devdependencies and even for nested dependencies etc)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;For each package version, pnpm reads the package&#39;s index files and every entry, &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;Hardlinks the corresponding content hash file from store/v11/files/xx/... into the node_modules/.pnpm/packageNmae@version&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Now pnpm links the top-level dependencies in our project main node_modules via symlinks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;Nested/transitive dependencies&lt;/span&gt; also&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt; symlink to its respective hardLinked folder&lt;/span&gt; created in&amp;nbsp; node_modules/.pnpm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="270" width="350" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="116" parent="12" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(204, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Inspect the node_modules folder of any project that uses pnpm, focus on the node_modules/.pnpm and nested/transitive dependencies of the packages&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="50" width="350" y="300" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="222" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=light-dark(#FFCD28,#004C99);strokeColor=#d79b00;gradientColor=#ffa500;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Projects referencing architecture&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="300" width="350" x="-290" y="870" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="110" x="-200" y="710" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="223" parent="222" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;All the local projects that use the pnpm and for globally installed packages, &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;pnpm creates a symlinked reference file, in its project folder in pnpm directory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Each folder name in this project folder is a &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(102, 0, 102));&quot;&gt;hash of their absolute path. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(204, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;check by calculating sha-256 hash of the folder absolute path, before runing pnpm add cmd&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Now when we run prune cmd, &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 102, 102));&quot;&gt;pnpm always checks this directory, for the check unreferenced/orphan packages&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(102, 102, 0));&quot;&gt;instead of scanning the whole operating system fies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;every time we run pnpm install/pnpm add cmd in any project, it get registered in this project directory&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: light-dark(rgb(204, 0, 0), rgb(204, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(192, 192, 192), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Run the pnpm prune cmd and notice the number of packages it is checking, and then count the number of projects in the project folder of pnpm directory&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="270" width="350" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="225" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=light-dark(#FFCD28,#003366);strokeColor=#d79b00;gradientColor=#ffa500;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Projects and packages unreferencing architecture&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="220" width="350" x="750" y="880" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="110" x="-200" y="710" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="226" parent="225" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;ANy project that we &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;delete or rename the project, it will obviously not match the symlinked project in the pnpm project directory&lt;/span&gt;, so the projects packages will be considered unreferenced/orphaned&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(204, 0, 0), rgb(153, 0, 0)); color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(250, 250, 250));&quot;&gt;Create a new project, run pnpm install cmd, then notice the pnpm project directory, now delete that newly created folder, then again notice the pnpm project directory&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="190" width="350" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="99" edge="1" parent="1" source="89" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;flowAnimation=1;" target="101">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <mxPoint x="489" y="2230" as="targetPoint"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="89" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;gradientColor=#ffd966;" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Problem Solved by pnpm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="130" width="440" x="270" y="2003" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="110" x="244" y="720" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
