                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="24" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#e6d0de;strokeColor=#996185;gradientColor=#d5739d;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(192, 192, 192), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;pnpm packages adding&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="280" width="360" x="220" y="-40" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="110" x="290" y="70" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="8" parent="24" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="1. pnpm stores/installs all the packages only once, in its global store folder" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="50" width="360" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="32" parent="24" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Before downloading: pnpm fetches the metadata of the package from the npm registry. This metadata includes the hash in data.integrity field&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Now pnpm check if any package with that same hash already &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 102, 102));&quot;&gt;exists in index.db&lt;/span&gt;, If yes then skip downloading that package tarball and reuse that&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;If no, then pnpm downloads package tarball and calculates the tarball hash to verify integrity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;On success verificaiton pnpm then &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 102, 102));&quot;&gt;calculates the hashes of the files in that package &lt;/span&gt;to organize the content-addressable store.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="200" width="360" y="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="79" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#e6d0de;strokeColor=#996185;gradientColor=#d5739d;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(192, 192, 192), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;pnpm complete packages Installation in a local project&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="230" width="420" x="-390" y="-340" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="110" x="-390" y="-340" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="81" parent="79" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Reads package.json and pnpm-lock.json, this resolve the full graph of the exact package versions needed (&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;resolved&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;For each resolved package version, checks if the hash already &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 102, 102));&quot;&gt;exists in index.db&lt;/span&gt;, If yes then skip downloading tarball and reuse that (&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;reused&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;If no, then pnpm downloads package tarball and calculates the tarball hash to verify integrity, unpack -&amp;gt; hash each file (&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;downloaded&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Link everything into this projects node_modules/.pnpm (&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;added&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="200" width="420" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="214" edge="1" parent="1" source="14" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.175;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;" target="211">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
